# Beyond Infinity, Balga's Dais (battlefield.beyond_infinity_balgas_dais): main registers and invites bob (accepted,
# clasp), cat (accepted, no clasp), dan (completed, no clasp) and eve (available, no clasp). Only the registrant
# needs the clasp: bob, cat and dan enter, eve gets no options. Atori-Tutori killed: the win for the party, each
# finish.
lists BalgasDais/BC_Entrance/onTrigger BalgasDais/onEventUpdate/32000 BalgasDais/onEventFinish/32000 BalgasDais/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=BalgasDais pos=300.4,-124.1,341.3 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=BalgasDais pos=300.4,-124.1,341.3 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=BalgasDais pos=300.4,-124.1,341.3 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=BalgasDais pos=300.4,-124.1,341.3 job=WAR lvl=75
char eve zone=BalgasDais pos=300.4,-124.1,341.3 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BeyondInfinity accepted
keyitem SoulGemClasp
bob: quest Jeuno.BeyondInfinity accepted
bob: keyitem SoulGemClasp
cat: quest Jeuno.BeyondInfinity accepted
dan: quest Jeuno.BeyondInfinity completed
login
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
cat: login
invite cat
cat: accept
dan: login
invite dan
dan: accept
eve: login
invite eve
eve: accept
trigger BC_Entrance
update 32000 option=321
finish
bob: trigger BC_Entrance
bob: update 32000 option=321
bob: finish
cat: trigger BC_Entrance
cat: update 32000 option=321
cat: finish
dan: trigger BC_Entrance
dan: update 32000 option=321
dan: finish
eve: trigger BC_Entrance
eve: update 32000 option=321
eve: finish
kill ATORI_TUTORI
finish
bob: finish
cat: finish
dan: finish
eve: finish
tick 11000
